### Outbox Saga Test Requests
### IntelliJ HTTP Client file
###
### Assumptions:
### - order-service runs on http://localhost:8081
### - inventory-service, payment-service, Kafka, and DBs are running
### - inventory seed contains:
###   SKU 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111 with enough stock
###   SKU 11111111-1111-1111-2222-111111111111 with limited stock
###
### Payment simulator assumptions:
### - paymentMethodId starting with 11111111 -> PaymentAuthorized
### - paymentMethodId starting with 22222222 -> PaymentFailed business failure
### - paymentMethodId starting with 33333333 -> simulated technical failure
### - amount > 1000.00 -> PaymentFailed business failure
###
### Important:
### For predictable results, start from a clean database:
### docker compose down -v
### docker compose up --build -d
###
### After each request, inspect:
### - orderdb.orders
### - orderdb.outbox_events
### - inventorydb.inventory_items
### - inventorydb.inventory_reservations
### - inventorydb.outbox_events
### - paymentdb.payments
### - paymentdb.outbox_events
### - Kafka UI: http://localhost:8085


@orderBaseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@json = application/json



### 5. Payment business failure: card declined
### Expected flow:
### POST /orders
### -> OrderCreated
### -> InventoryReserved
### -> PaymentRequested
### -> PaymentFailed
### -> InventoryReleaseRequested
### -> InventoryReleased
### -> order status = CANCELLED
### -> inventory reservation status = RELEASED
### -> نوع خطا
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "paymentMethodId": "22222222-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 50.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 50.00
    }
  ]
}


### 6. Payment business failure: amount exceeds test authorization limit
### Expected flow:
### POST /orders
### -> OrderCreated
### -> InventoryReserved
### -> PaymentRequested
### -> PaymentFailed
### -> InventoryReleaseRequested
### -> InventoryReleased
### -> order status = CANCELLED
### -> نوع خطا
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "paymentMethodId": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 1200.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 600.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 1200.00
    }
  ]
}


### 7. Payment technical failure
### Expected flow:
### POST /orders
### -> OrderCreated
### -> InventoryReserved
### -> PaymentRequested
### -> payment-service throws technical exception
### -> payment transaction rollback
### -> event retried by Kafka consumer
### -> eventually DLT if failure continues
### Expected order state:
### - remains PAYMENT_PENDING
### Expected inventory state:
### - reservation remains RESERVED
### This is correct because technical failure is not a business decline.
###؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟؟
POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "paymentMethodId": "33333333-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 50.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 50.00
    }
  ]
}


### 8. Duplicate SKU lines in one order
### Expected:
### - order-service stores two order_items
### - inventory-service groups quantities by SKU
### - stock reservation uses summed quantity
### - happy path if stock is available

POST {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "requestId": "10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "checkoutId": "20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "customerId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "paymentMethodId": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000007",
  "currency": "DKK",
  "totalAmount": 100.00,
  "items": [
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 50.00
    },
    {
      "skuId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "productName": "Demo Product A",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 50.00,
      "itemTotalPrice": 50.00
    }
  ]
}


