### 13. Manual Kafka test: invalid OrderCreated payload
### This cannot be sent through HTTP.
### Use Kafka UI -> topic order.created.v1 -> Produce Message.
### Payload:
###
### {
###   "eventId": null,
###   "orderId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
###   "items": []
### }
###
### Expected:
### - inventory-service rejects it
### - message goes to order.created.v1.DLT
### - no inventory update
### - no inventory outbox event


### 14. Manual Kafka test: invalid PaymentRequested payload
### Use Kafka UI -> topic payment.requested.v1 -> Produce Message.
### Payload:
###
### {
###   "eventId": null,
###   "orderId": "bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb",
###   "amount": -10.00,
###   "currency": "DKK",
###   "paymentMethodId": "11111111-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"
### }
###
### Expected:
### - payment-service rejects it
### - message goes to payment.requested.v1.DLT
### - no payment row
### - no payment outbox event
